From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LingkodAI <noreply@lingkodai.invalid>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:05:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ICL clone: optional non_streaming_mode=True prompt layout

Upstream qwen-tts generate_icl_prompt has two branches. qwentts.cpp
ports non_streaming_mode=False (text and codec streams aligned to the
codec length and summed). LingkodAI's evaluated Stage 7 calls
generate_voice_clone with non_streaming_mode=True, which concatenates
the streams instead: [ref_text ; text ; tts_eos] over codec_pad, then
[codec_bos ; ref_codes] over tts_pad, trailing text = tts_pad.

Adds qt_init_params.icl_non_streaming (ABI 6, tail field, gated on
abi_version, default false so upstream behaviour is unchanged), the
--icl-non-streaming flag on qwen-tts and tts-server, and --non-streaming
on tests/debug-clone-cossim.py to validate the layout against Python.
